'<h4>Purpose</h4>',
'<p>',
'  This attribute allows to add entries to existing list defined in',
'  <i>Shared Componenets > Lists</i>. Sequence order of list entries can be ',
'  set using <strong>seq</strong> property of each new item. ',
'</p>'))
);
