'<p>',
'If SQL Query is defined as below:',
'</p>',
'<p>',
'<pre><code>select',
'  EMPNO r,',
'  ENAME d,',
'  JOB,',
'  MGR,',
'  HIREDATE,',
'  SAL,',
'  COMM,',
'  DEPTNO',
'from',
'  emp</code></pre>',
'</p>',
'<p>',
'The example <strong>Custom template</strong> can be defined as:',
