,p_plug_name=>'Caution'
,p_parent_plug_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(19874473394358992)
,p_region_template_options=>'#DEFAULT#:t-Region--noPadding:is-collapsed:t-Region--noBorder:t-Region--scrollBody:margin-top-none:margin-bottom-none'
,p_plug_template=>wwv_flow_imp.id(519873684851673769)
,p_plug_display_sequence=>20
,p_plug_header=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<div class="boilerplate-tip">',
'   <p>Lack of integrity in the data means that observations cannot be reliably retrieved using generic criteria.',
'   </p>   ',
'   <p>There are cases where MEDS_PROCESSING_JOB.DATA_TYPE matches neither USAGE nor DESCRIPTION in the Data Type definitions in JOB_LOOKUPS. ',
'   </p>   ',
'   <p>As a result (for example), a Sound Velocity filter will not return MEDS_PROCESSING_JOB data where the DATA_TYPE is ''Observed Physical Data'' (a value that does not exist in JOB_LOOKUPS).',
'   </p>   ',
'   <p>For now, this data can only be retrieved by filtering on the given MEIC or JOB_NUMBER.',
'   </p>   ',
'</div>'))
,p_attribute_01=>'N'
,p_attribute_02=>'HTML'
);
